Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

I downloaded the JMS Client from: http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg24012804
The name of clien jar file is : sibc_install-o0902.06.jar

Extract it with command "java –jar sibc_install-o0902.06.jar jms_ibm C:\jms>"

Check in the file sibc.jms.jar to adks/websphere/esb/6.1 in cmvc.

I did not install the entire product because we did not need it.

